{"declarations":[{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.elabDoAssertion\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabDoAssertion</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Do/Basic.html#Lean.Elab.Do.DoElab\">Do.DoElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.elabDoAssertion","kind":"def","line":229,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.elabDoAssertion","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.lean#L229-L246"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.elabContractNotice\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabContractNotice</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Command.html#Lean.Elab.Command.CommandElab\">Command.CommandElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Report the experimental status of each contract clause the notice carries, in a slight\ncommand-level misuse of a `contractDeclVal` node. Does not change the environment.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.elabContractNotice","kind":"def","line":217,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.elabContractNotice","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.lean#L217-L226"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.elabContractEPosts\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">elabContractEPosts</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Elab/Term/TermElabM.html#Lean.Elab.Term.TermElab\">Term.TermElab</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Elaborating `contract_eposts% e` unfolds the `EPostSlot.set` applications and `⊥` in `e`, e.g.\nto an `estack⟨...⟩` expression. Used in the expansion of `throws` clauses to yield simpler specs.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.elabContractEPosts","kind":"def","line":193,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.elabContractEPosts","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.lean#L193-L214"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.expandDefContract\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">expandDefContract</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Macro\">Macro</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Expand a `def` carrying `given`/`requires`/`ensures`/`throws` clauses into the plain `def`\nplus a spec theorem `@[spec] theorem f.spec : ∀ xs, ⦃P⦄ f args ⦃fun b => Q; E⦄` proved by\n`vcgen`. A `where finally | spec => steps` section supplies `grind`-mode steps for the\nverification conditions `finish` leaves open.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.expandDefContract","kind":"def","line":87,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.expandDefContract","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.lean#L87-L181"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">def</span><span class=\"decl_name\"> <a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.contractBinderIdents\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Elab</span>.<span class=\"name\">Tactic</span>.<span class=\"name\">Do</span>.<span class=\"name\">contractBinderIdents</span></a> </span><span class=\"decl_args\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">binder</span> : <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Lean.Syntax\">Syntax</a>)</span></span> <span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Array\">Array</a> <a href=\"./Init/Meta/Defs.html#Lean.Syntax.Ident\">Ident</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The identifiers bound by an explicit `(…)` binder, used to apply the definition in its spec.","docLink":"./Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.html#Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.contractBinderIdents","kind":"def","line":37,"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.contractBinderIdents","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/c9afcddf514a6772bd4d649f7cfc04eff0b9f15e/src/Lean/Elab/Tactic/Do/Contract.lean#L37-L43"}}],"imports":["Init.Grind.Interactive","Init.Syntax","Lean.DocString.Extension","Lean.Elab.Command","Lean.Elab.Do.Basic","Lean.Elab.Util","Lean.Meta.Tactic.Simp.Main","Lean.Parser.Command","Lean.Parser.Do","Lean.Parser.Term","Std.Tactic.Do.Syntax","Std.WP"],"instances":[],"name":"Lean.Elab.Tactic.Do.Contract"}